  - rid: 3881257763861653110
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 8844046230112102412
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: People are already asking when the garden will open.
    - rid: 5809915938811059910
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Tell them soon.
    - rid: 2469429878704354405
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: But not too soon.
    - rid: 3261421738286269291
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: 'There are two standards: safe and finished.'
    - rid: 7187669169317613020
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4a74f0f2261874b962f568ba22424d, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Three. It must also be welcoming.
    - rid: 8169114165723542866
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Four. There must be coffee.
    - rid: 7859453991286700582
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Coffee was already assumed.
    - rid: 6792204306811721174
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Five. It needs a good opening-day photo.
    - rid: 7946119642369975538
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: For once, everyone agrees about what this place should be.
    - rid: 3881257763861653110
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4a74f0f2261874b962f568ba22424d, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: That is because it is beginning to feel like it belongs to everyone
          again.
